{"name":"-62-4","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"REDNET","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"10030","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"System","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Battle finished. Enemy HQ 68% destroyed.","style":{"color":"#FFFF00"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Supplementary exam evaluation—pass.","style":{"color":"#FFFF00"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Exam progress 50%, loading next stage...","style":{"color":"#FFFF00"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Phew! Finally a pass. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Things really are completely different with an extra person."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Carcano1938","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carcano M91/38","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was coerced."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're here already, so why not get a little serious? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As far as I can tell, Ceno isn't giving it her 100%. We've got more space to improve in the next stage. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As for you, rookie, not shabby at all! Getting used to the simulation yet?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah, yes... Thank you, Captain. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My accuracy isn't the best yet, but I'll do my best."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That was already pretty good at those ranges. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You could try hanging out at the frontlines with me later, I'll cover you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I wouldn't do that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If my hunch is correct, we've got Paradeus coming up next; they're the hardest to deal with."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Zzp— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As if responding to Type 80's predictions, a new scenario begins to load..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG_City","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Carcano1938","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carcano M91/38","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is... Belgrade?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I-I know this one! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Belgrade was the first time the Commander performed an important escort mission in foreign territory. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Here, the main enemy that the Commander encountered was... Paradeus!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh, would you look at that. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How'd you guess that, Type 80?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unlike the previous two stages, there isn't any trace of large-scale military activity nearby. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is the danger that Paradeus smells of."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not bad! Never would have guessed that you've got an eye for these things on top of being good in the field."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"80typeMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 80","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The target area is confirmed, so let's draft up a plan. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's just, rookie... Type 80's right, I can't have you in the vanguard this time. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Paradeus is a bit too much for you to deal with."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CMR30","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CMR-30","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"CMR-30 lowers her head, somewhat despondent."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Carcano1938","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carcano M91/38","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah, it's good to be young! To do nothing and get by with the help of my seniors... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If it were possible, I'd love to be ten years younger too—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thompson gives Ceno a good smack upside the head."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bloody good-for-nothing... Get over here, we're having a meeting! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't listen to Ceno, CMR-30. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After Paradeus is dealt with, I'll cover you as many times as you want! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Improvement always comes a step at a time. Don't be so worried!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Encouraged by Thompson's words, CMR-30's eyes light up again as she nods seriously."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
